{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-1","title":"1 Peter 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He teaches the duty of wives and husbands to each other; 8 exhorting all men to unity and love; 14 and to suffer persecution. 19 He declares also the benefits of Christ toward the old world.</p>\n<p>ye. Ge 3:16; Es 1:16-20; Ro 7:2; *Gr: 1Co 11:3; 14:34; Eph 5:22-24,33; Col 3:18; 1Ti 2:11,12; Tit 2:3-6 obey. 1:22; 4:17; Ro 6:17; 10:16; 2Th 1:8; Heb 5:9; 11:8 they. 1Co 7:16; Col 4:5 won. Pr 11:30; 18:19; Mt 18:15; 1Co 9:19-22; Jas 5:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-2","title":"1 Peter 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>behold. 16; 1:15; 2:12; Php 1:27; 3:20; 1Ti 4:12; 2Pe 3:11 with. 5,6,15; Eph 5:33; 6:5; Col 3:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-3","title":"1 Peter 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>adorning let. 1Ti 2:9,10; Tit 2:3-15; Ro 12:2 that. Ge 24:22,47,53; Ex 3:22; 32:2; 33:4; 35:22; 38:8; 2Ki 9:30; Es 5:1 Ps 45:9; Isa 3:18-24; 52:1; 61:10; Jer 2:32; 4:30; Eze 16:7-13; 23:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-4","title":"1 Peter 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the hidden. Ps 45:13; 51:6; Mt 23:26; Lu 11:40; Ro 2:29; 6:6; 7:22; 2Co 4:16 Eph 4:22-24; Col 3:3,9,10 which is not. 1:23 a meek. 15; Ps 25:9; 147:6; 149:4; Isa 11:4; 29:19; 57:15; 61:1; Mt 5:5; 11:29 Mt 21:5; 2Co 10:1; Ga 5:23; Eph 4:2; Col 3:12; 2Ti 2:25; Tit 3:2 Jas 1:21; 3:13-17 quiet. Ps 131:2; Jer 51:59; 1Th 4:11; 2Th 3:12; 1Ti 2:2 which is in. 1Sa 16:7; Ps 147:10,11; 149:4; Lu 16:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-5","title":"1 Peter 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the holy. Pr 31:10,30; Lu 8:2,3; Ac 1:14; 9:36; 1Ti 2:10; 5:10; Tit 2:3,4 who. 1Sa 2:1; Jer 49:11; Lu 2:37; 1Ti 2:15; 5:5; Heb 11:11 adorned. 2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-6","title":"1 Peter 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>as Sara. Ge 18:12 daughters. Gr. children. Ro 9:7-9; Ga 4:22-26 and. 14,15; Ge 18:15; Isa 57:11; Da 3:16-18; Mt 26:69-75; Ac 4:8-13,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-7","title":"1 Peter 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>ye. Ge 2:23,24; Pr 5:15-19; Mal 2:14-16; Mt 19:3-9; 1Co 7:3; Col 3:19 Eph 5:25-28,33 giving. 1Co 12:22-24; 1Th 4:4 heirs. Eph 3:6; Tit 3:7; Heb 1:14 that. Job 42:8; Mt 5:23,24; 18:19; Ro 8:26,27; Eph 4:30; 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-8","title":"1 Peter 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>be. Ac 2:1; 4:32; Ro 12:16; 15:5; 1Co 1:10; Php 3:16 having. Zec 7:9; Mt 18:33; Lu 10:33; Ro 12:15; 1Co 12:26; Jas 2:13; 3:17 love as brethren. or, loving to the brethren. 1:22; 2:17; Ro 12:10; Heb 13:1; 2Pe 1:7; 1Jo 3:14,18,19 pitiful. Ps 103:13; Pr 28:8; Mt 18:33; Jas 5:11 courteous. Ac 27:3; 28:7; Eph 4:31,32; 5:1,2; Php 4:8,9; Col 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-9","title":"1 Peter 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>rendering. 2:20-23; Pr 17:13; 20:22; Mt 5:39,44; Lu 6:27-29; Ro 12:14,17,19-21 1Co 4:12,13; Eph 4:32; 1Th 5:15 called. 2:21; 5:10; Ro 8:28,30 that. Mt 19:29; 25:34; Mr 10:17; Lu 10:25; 18:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-10","title":"1 Peter 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he. Ps 34:12-16 love. D