14; Isa 5:16; 29:23 and be. Ps 119:46; Jer 26:12-16; Da 3:16-18; Am 7:14-17; Mt 10:18-20 Lu 21:14,15; Ac 4:8-12; 5:29-31; 21:39,40; 22:1,2-5; Col 4:6 2Ti 2:25 a reason. 1Sa 12:7; Isa 1:18; 41:21; Ac 24:25 the hope. 1:3,4; Col 1:5,23,27; Tit 1:2; Heb 3:6; 6:1,18,19 with. 2,4; 2Ti 2:25,26 fear. or, reverence.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-16","title":"1 Peter 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a good. 21; 2:19; Ac 24:16; Ro 9:1; 2Co 1:12; 4:2; 1Ti 1:5,19; 2Ti 1:3 Heb 9:14; 13:18 whereas. 2:12; Tit 2:8 falsely. Mt 5:11 good. 1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-17","title":"1 Peter 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>if. 4:19; Mt 26:39,42; Ac 21:14 suffer. 14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-18","title":"1 Peter 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Christ. 2:21-24; 4:1; Isa 53:4-6; Ro 5:6-8; 8:3; 2Co 5:21; Ga 1:4; 3:13 Tit 2:14; Heb 9:26,28 the just. Zec 9:9; Mt 27:19,24; Ac 3:14; 22:14; Jas 5:6; 1Jo 1:9 that. Eph 2:16-18 being. 4:1; Da 9:26; Ro 4:25; 2Co 1:24; 13:4; Col 1:21,22 but. Ro 1:4; 8:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-19","title":"1 Peter 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>By which. 1:11,12; 4:6; Ne 9:30; Re 19:10 in. Isa 42:7; 49:9; 61:1; Re 20:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-3-20","title":"1 Peter 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>sometime. Ge 6:3,5,13 the longsuffering. Isa 30:18; Ro 2:4,5; 9:22; 2Pe 3:15 the days. Mt 24:37-39; Lu 17:26-30 while. Ge 6:14-22; Heb 11:7 wherein. Ge 7:1-7,13,23; 8:1,18; Mt 7:14; Lu 12:32; 13:24,25; 2Pe 2:5 by. Ge 7:17-23; 2Co 2:15,16; Eph 5:26</p>"